<body>
<div class="page">

  <header class="header">
    <p class="eyebrow">U.S. Macroeconomic Indicators · 2021–2024</p>
    <h1>The Inflation Spiral:<br>Prices, Wages &amp; the Federal Response</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Four interacting forces defined American economic life from 2021 to 2024: a surge in consumer prices outpaced wage growth, eroding real purchasing power for two years before the Federal Reserve's aggressive rate hikes finally brought inflation to heel — with a visible lag.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="legend">
    <div class="legend-item">
      <div class="legend-line" style="background:var(--cpi);height:3px;"></div>
      <div class="legend-label">
